00:33:35.790 --> 00:33:38.070
So we've definitely seen
a huge increase in load

00:33:38.070 --> 00:33:39.550
on the platform.

00:33:39.550 --> 00:33:41.420
I guess that's the main effect,

00:33:41.420 --> 00:33:43.220
the effect on the organization,

00:33:43.220 --> 00:33:44.730
obviously as the organization,

00:33:44.730 --> 00:33:47.230
everyone is now working remotely

00:33:47.230 --> 00:33:50.860
and people are dealing with their own...

00:33:50.860 --> 00:33:52.710
Some people have young kids,
I have young kids at home

00:33:52.710 --> 00:33:54.270
but I have a lot of
support at home as well

00:33:54.270 --> 00:33:56.680
but you could imagine a lot
of folks have young kids

00:33:56.680 --> 00:33:58.720
and so we're trying to work
with all of our team members

00:33:58.720 --> 00:34:00.640
to make sure that they
feel fully supported

00:34:00.640 --> 00:34:02.900
as they have all of
these competing tensions.

00:34:02.900 --> 00:34:04.120
And just as an organization,

00:34:04.120 --> 00:34:06.080
we're trying to accelerate forward

00:34:06.080 --> 00:34:07.740
as many things as we can do.

00:34:07.740 --> 00:34:12.210
But as I said earlier,
most of our resources

00:34:12.210 --> 00:34:16.090
come from philanthropy, so that's a lot,

00:34:16.090 --> 00:34:17.730
that's very front of mind these days

00:34:17.730 --> 00:34:19.850
is making sure we can raise enough money

00:34:19.850 --> 00:34:22.080
to do the things we're already doing,

00:34:22.080 --> 00:34:23.820
especially to the earlier question,

00:34:23.820 --> 00:34:26.050
we're going into harder economic times,

00:34:26.050 --> 00:34:27.450
who knows what happens to donations

00:34:27.450 --> 00:34:28.470
over the next couple of months?

00:34:28.470 --> 00:34:30.920
So I'm definitely, that's
some, a little thing

00:34:30.920 --> 00:34:32.800
that I sometimes wake up and think about

00:34:32.800 --> 00:34:36.160
and how could we potentially
get more resources

00:34:36.160 --> 00:34:37.420
so that we can accelerate even more,

00:34:37.420 --> 00:34:40.410
add more subject areas, improve
our platform, et cetera.

00:34:40.410 --> 00:34:42.030
So that's kind of the stuff

00:34:42.030 --> 00:34:44.880
that at the Khan Academy level
we've been thinking about.

